24. Charged total = 33.36. Refund = 33.36 - 24.224 = 9.136, rounded up to SGD 9.15. That is above the SGD 0.50 de minimis floor and below 90% of the charged total, so the outcome is PARTIAL_REFUND of SGD 9.15.\n\n4) ERP. The off-route Tuas South Avenue 8 loop line (SGD 2.00) is already comprehended in that refund, because the recomputed fare carries only gantries on the optimal route; it is itemised for transparency and is not added on top (POL-RD-09(1)). The Pioneer Road inbound line (SGD 1.00) lies on the optimal route and is properly part of the recomputed fare. No separate pass-through correction is due.\n\n5) Driver compensation. None is payable: the billed distance (16.2 km) equals the trace distance, so there is no unbilled shortfall exceeding 1.0 km (POL-RD-04 compensation limb)."
